WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.249
Sid felt bad.

2
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:16.051
"Sorry about your tower, Rex," he said.

3
00:00:16.052 --> 00:00:23.975
Rex sighed. "It's okay."

4
00:00:23.976 --> 00:00:40.854
He stacked rocks again.

5
00:00:40.855 --> 00:00:44.536
Tor stopped playing.

6
00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:50.315
"Our band is missing something," she said.

7
00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.301
"What?" Sara asked.

8
00:00:53.302 --> 00:00:56.203
"I don't know," Tor said.

9
00:00:56.204 --> 00:01:00.014
"But we need something."

10
00:01:00.015 --> 00:01:04.813
Sara shrugged. "I think we sound great."

11
00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:11.416
She shook her seed pods.

12
00:01:11.417 --> 00:01:16.456
Just then Rex made a soft roar.

13
00:01:16.457 --> 00:01:21.301
"I finished my tower!"

14
00:01:21.302 --> 00:01:24.471
"That's it!" Tor cried.

15
00:01:24.472 --> 00:01:29.224
"Huh?" Rex was confused.

16
00:01:29.225 --> 00:01:33.142
"Our band is missing you, Rex," Tor said.

17
00:01:33.143 --> 00:01:36.191
"You can roar!"

18
00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:44.100
Rex smiled. "Okay!"

19
00:01:44.101 --> 00:01:47.507
The buddies played music together.

20
00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:54.754
Rex roared as Sara shook her seed pods.

21
00:01:54.755 --> 00:01:58.170
Tor played her flute.

22
00:01:58.171 --> 00:02:03.568
Sid slapped his tail.

23
00:02:03.569 --> 00:02:08.581
But he wasn't careful.

24
00:02:08.582 --> 00:02:10.063
Wham!

25
00:02:10.064 --> 00:02:14.338
Rex's tall tower fell down.

26
00:02:14.339 --> 00:02:18.555
Sid grinned. "Oops."

27
00:02:18.556 --> 00:02:29.102
Everyone laughed—even Rex.

